Ok, so the core game concept will be: 

Name:Flappy Happy: Bird Preserve

The player is a wildlife ranger building a bird sanctuary. Birds appear across different habitats, each with rarity tiers from common to legendary. The player uses nets, bait, timing, and upgrades to catch birds safely. Captured birds are added to a collection, studied, and either released for conservation points or kept in the preserve as part of a living aviary.
